Z||000000||strutter||04-16-2000||07:14 PM||||While going from park to neutral or drive, I have a loud thump in what sounds like the transmission area.  I've been told it could be the motor mounts.  The car is 1984 4 cylinder 2M4.  Has anybody had this problem?||||reg||5
Z||000001||theogre||04-16-2000||09:18 PM||||you answered your own question. go check the mounts. all of them. including the "dog bone" up top.||||reg||1
Z||000002||TalShino||04-16-2000||09:30 PM||||Check the two bolts to make sure they are tight that hold the doggie bone mount to the motor, mine were loose and caused a rather loud and unliked THUMP!<P>Ray||||reg||1
